  "duration": 32.0,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "id": "S06.1",
    "spoken": "Here's the cap: a flat line at five hundred thousand dollars, the same in every quarter.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 5.92
   },
   {
    "id": "S06.2",
    "spoken": "And here's their gain on paper, for a home that rose like the average: the two hundred thousand dollars, grown with the index, less the two hundred thousand dollars they paid.",
    "start": 6.08,
    "end": 17.2
   },
   {
    "id": "S06.3",
    "spoken": "For most of these years, it sits well under the line.",
    "start": 17.44,
    "end": 21.28
   },
   {
    "id": "S06.4",
    "spoken": "Then, in the second quarter of twenty twenty-two, it crosses.",
    "start": 21.456,
    "end": 25.52
   },
   {
    "id": "S06.5",
    "spoken": "It slips back under for a while.",
    "start": 25.76,
    "end": 27.84
   },
   {
    "id": "S06.6",
    "spoken": "From the second quarter of twenty twenty-three, it has stayed above.",
    "start": 27.952,
    "end": 32.0
   }
  ],
